## Why This Is Asked

Tests the ability to design isolation, backpressure controls, and controlled degradation under burst traffic, with clear rollback criteria and observability.

## Key Concepts

- Tenant isolation via edge throttling and per-tenant queues
- Backpressure mechanisms and circuit breakers
- Safe degradation strategies and cache fallbacks
- Telemetry: p95/p99 latency, error rate, queue depth, saturation
- Clear rollback criteria and automation

## Code Example

```javascript
// Simple token bucket limiter
class TokenBucket {
  constructor(rate, capacity) {
    this.rate = rate;
    this.capacity = capacity;
    this.tokens = capacity;
    this.last = Date.now();
  }
  allow() {
    const now = Date.now();
    const elapsed = (now - this.last) / 1000;
    this.tokens = Math.min(this.capacity, this.tokens + elapsed * this.rate);
    this.last = now;
    if (this.tokens >= 1) {
      this.tokens -= 1;
      return true;
    }
    return false;
  }
}
```

## Follow-up Questions

- How would you validate plan with load tests and synthetic surges?
- What metrics and thresholds would trigger a rollback, and how would you automate it?

## Why This Is Asked

Gauges ability to manage per-tenant QoS under bursty traffic and to design practical safeguards that minimize blast radius.

## Key Concepts

- Per-tenant QoS and quotas
- Backpressure and prioritization
- Isolation and graceful degradation
- Telemetry, SLO-driven rollback

## Code Example

```javascript
class TokenBucket {
  constructor(rate, burst) {
    this.rate = rate; this.burst = burst; this.tokens = burst; this.last = Date.now();
  }
  allow() {
    const now = Date.now();
    const delta = (now - this.last) / 1000;
    this.tokens = Math.min(this.burst, this.tokens + delta * this.rate);
    this.last = now;
    if (this.tokens >= 1) { this.tokens -= 1; return true; }
    return false;
  }
}
```

## Follow-up Questions

- How would you adapt this for a service mesh with mutual TLS and header-based routing?
- How would you test failover and simulate tenant backoffs in a staging environment?
